{"type":"standard","title":"2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Montana","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Montana</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q135116933","titles":{"canonical":"2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Montana","normalized":"2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Montana","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Montana</span></span>"},"pageid":80206902,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/af/Great_Seal_of_Montana.svg/330px-Great_Seal_of_Montana.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":332},"originalimage":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/af/Great_Seal_of_Montana.svg/960px-Great_Seal_of_Montana.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":713,"height":717},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1376975246","tid":"68d4ba1d-ba35-11f1-ba64-943632d4c0db","timestamp":"2026-09-27T05:36:38Z","description":"","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Montana","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Montana?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Montana?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Montana"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Montana","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Montana","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Montana?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:2026_United_States_House_of_Representatives_elections_in_Montana"}},"extract":"The 2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Montana will be held on November 3, 2026, to elect the two U.S. representatives from the state of Montana, one from each of the state's congressional districts. The elections will coincide with other elections to the House of Representatives, elections to the United States Senate, and various state and local elections. The primary elections took place on June 2, 2026.","extract_html":"<p>The <b>2026 United States House of Representatives elections in Montana</b> will be held on November 3, 2026, to elect the two U.S. representatives from the state of Montana, one from each of the state's congressional districts. The elections will coincide with other elections to the House of Representatives, elections to the United States Senate, and various state and local elections. The primary elections took place on June 2, 2026.</p>"}